# Local secrets for `wrangler dev`. Do NOT commit this file.
# Format: KEY=value (one per line). Values here are loaded into env at dev time only.
# For production, use `wrangler secret put SECRET_TOKEN`.
#
# SECRET_TOKEN=pick-a-long-random-string-here
#
# Bearer token the mail-agent /mcp route validates (same value as its MCP_AUTH_TOKEN).
# AGENT_MCP_TOKEN=your-mcp-auth-token-here
